      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could consider removing the \"run-probe\" property, and letting the board code decide which sensors to probe.\n\nSomething like:\n    if (probe_sensor(\u003clabel\u003e))\n        replace_alt_motion_sensor(\u003clabel\u003e)\n        \nI think a doc is probably warranted to describe the known use cases for replacing sensors and USB-C chips.",
